{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25479","headline":"思平泉树石杂咏一十首 海上石笋 · 李德裕","name":"思平泉树石杂咏一十首 海上石笋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"常爱仙都山，奇峰千仞悬。\n迢迢一何迥，不与衆山连。\n忽逢海峤石，稍慰平生忆。\n何以慰我心，亭亭孤且直。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25479.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25479","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}